# LiqueAmp cloud backend (Supabase, D16) — OPTIONAL.
# Without these, LiqueAmp is built without accounts and works fully locally.
#
# Everything in a VITE_* variable is compiled into the PUBLIC JavaScript
# bundle. Only put public values here:
#   - the project URL
#   - the PUBLISHABLE (anon) key
# NEVER a secret / service_role key: the build refuses one
# (src/services/account/config.ts). Access control is enforced server-side
# with row-level security, not by keeping these values secret.
#
# For GitHub Pages, set them as GitHub Actions variables for the build step.
# Register the auth callback for every origin the app runs on, e.g.
#   https://thermoptic.github.io/LiqueAmp/auth/callback
#   http://localhost:5173/LiqueAmp/auth/callback
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
